    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to bring to the market this exciting four-bedroom bungalow, commanding beautiful elevated views over Red Strand and the Atlantic Ocean\r\n\r\nDating from 1974, this spacious residence extends to approximately 130 sq. m. (1,400 sq. ft.), together with an attached garage, and occupies a site of approximately 0.214 acres. The property offers a rare blank canvas for those seeking to create their own coastal retreat in one of West Cork’s most beautiful settings.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated alongside a working farm and is approximately 12 minutes’ drive from the picturesque village of Rosscarbery and 15 minutes from the multi-award-winning town of Clonakilty. Cork City International Airport is approximately one hour away by car. The popular Fishers Cross pub is approximately one mile away, while Ardfield villageis approximately two miles from the property.\r\n\r\nJoint Agents with Martin Kelleher Auctioneers, Clonakilty, Cork.\r\n\r\nPorch\r\nEntrance porch leading into the main hall, with fitted storage.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nWelcoming entrance hall providing access to the principal accommodation.\r\n\r\nSitting Room 6.5 m x 2.5 m & 1.9 m x 1.8 m\r\nA bright and spacious reception room enjoying superb natural light and wonderful views. Windows face south and west, taking full advantage of the elevated outlook over Red Strand beach and the Atlantic Ocean Fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen 5.9m x 3.3m\r\nFitted with existing kitchen units and incorporating a west-facing window with views towards the sea. Door leading through to the utility room.\r\n\r\nUtility Room 4.6m x 2.4m\r\nUseful utility area with fitted units, side access and internal access to the attached garage.\r\n\r\nAttached Garage 7.2m x 3.6m & 2.6m x 2.5m\r\nGenerous attached garage with roller door and pedestrian access. The garage also benefits from direct internal access from the utility room.\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.3m x 3.3m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted storage and superb views towards Red Strand and the sea.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 3.3m x 3.8m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted storage and excellent views towards Red Strand and the Atlantic Ocean.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 3.3m x 4.0m\r\nWell-proportioned double bedroom with fitted storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.9m x 3.3m\r\nFitted with bath, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four 3.6m x 3.3m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted storage.\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains water connection. Septic tank with registered right of way access.\r\nHeating via oil fired central heating and open fire.\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\n\r\nOutbuildings\r\nDetached steel frame garage c. 25 Sqm. Connection for power."
      },
